{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03151","headline":"候使登石头驿楼作 · 张九龄","name":"候使登石头驿楼作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山槛凭南望，川途眇北流。\n远林天翠合，前浦日华浮。\n万井缘津渚，千艘咽渡头。\n渔商多末事，耕稼少良畴。\n自守陈蕃榻，尝登王粲楼。\n徒然骋目处，岂是获心游。\n向迹虽愚谷，求名异盗丘。\n息阴芳木所，空复越乡忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}